        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhūgūlwa kwa bahemba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu wandya kūbawīla a banhū hamò na a bahemba bakwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī, “A balangi ba shilagīlo na a Bafalisayo, balī h'isumbī lya ng'wa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, īdimagi pyī īyo bakamuwīlaga, nīyo g'wīshikīlīja. Gwike yaya ū kwīta ūmo bakīītīlaga a boi, nguno bakayombaga dūhū, alīyo yaya ū kūshikīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī bakatungaga miligo midito bayūbaseseja a banhū kū mabega kwībūūcha, alīyo a boi benekīlī batī n'iganiko lya kwībūūcha nūūlū hado; nūūlū ni kūkuumya ho na lwala lwabo dūhū biya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pyī ī milīmo yabo bakīītaga gīkī babonwe na banhū; ū gwabo gūlī gwa kwikala būkūlīlīja fulakitelia jabo, na kūlīhīlīja masune ga ng'hanjo jabo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu masinagogi batogilwe kwigasīja masumbī g'ikūjo; hama nūūlū būlaalīkwa kūja kū shigukulu, nū kwene bakakūūbīlījaga ha magele ga bakūjiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye na mu magūlilū hose bagaagaanile kwikala būgīshiwa na kwitanwa, ‘Nangi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we yaya ū kwikala mukwitanagwa, ‘Nangi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nangi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Rabi, a makūlū ga Rabi gene Nangi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nguno ū Nangi wing'we alī ūmò dūhū, lelo a bing'we pyī mulī badūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī yaya ū kūng'witana munhū nūūlū ūmò ū mu sī ūmu gīkī, ‘Baba’ nguno mulī na Sīng'we ūmò ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo a bing'we yaya ū kwitanwa ‘Bataale’ nguno ū Ntaale wing'we alī ūmò dūhū, ng'wene Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a bing'we ū ntaale wing'we h'ūyo akūbiza ntūmami wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ū wa kwigūngūhya wei ng'wenekīlī, akūdohelejiwa, alīyo ū wa kwidohya, ū ng'wene akūgūngūhiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koolomiwa Bafalisayo na balangi ba shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo bibeeleja, mulī mu kwihīga; nguno mukabalugalīlaga a banhū ū būtemi bo ng'wigūlū. A bing'we mulemeelilwe ū kwingīla, alīyo na a babo batogilwe ū kwingīla mutabazunīlījaga ū kūbīta! [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo bibeeleja, bing'we abo mukalyaga sabo ja bakīma bachīlwa, na kūlomba kalombele kalīhu ka kwiyoolecha; managi gīkī a bing'we mukūpandīka nsango ntaale kūtinda!] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga kūtaale no a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo, nguno mukakīlaga manyanza na magūngūli kūjūhembeka munhū ūmò; hama ūlū ng'wang'hembeka hūna ng'wang'wenheleja kūbiza munhū wa kūjimīlīla mu nsango gwa moto gīt'ūmo mulī a bing'we, na kūtinda ho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we batongeeji mulī mu kwihīga, nguno mulī babboku, ng'wakūyūlanga gīkī, ‘Munhū ose ose nūūlū akitonga kūnū akwīhayaga hekalu atūbonelwa mhayo, alīyo ūlū witonga mu kūjihaya hela ījo jilīmo ū mu hekalu, ū ng'wenūyo wigwashaga!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we babbūūlī na babboku, ī shitaale ni shilī ginehe? Ī hela, nūūlū ī hekalu īyo īkajeejaga ī hela? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī mukalangaga gīkī, ‘Munhū ose ose nūūlū akitonga mu kūgūhaya ng'walīlo atūbonelwa mhayo, alīyo ūlū witonga mu kūshihaya ī shitambo īsho shilī a ha ng'walīlo, ū ng'wenūyo wigwashaga!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we babboku, ī shitaale ni shilī ginehe? Ī shitambo, nūūlū ū ng'walīlo ūyo gūkasheejaga ī shitambo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū managi gīkī, būlī munhū ūlū witonga mu kūgūhaya ng'walīlo, numho witongaga mu lina lyago ū ng'walīlo, hamò nī shikolo īsho shilī higūlya yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū yūyo witonga kūnū akwīhayaga hekalu, numho witongaga mu lina lyayo, nū yūyo akikalaga mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nūūlū munhū witonga mu kūlīhaya igūlū, numho witongaga kū lina ly'isumbī lya ng'wa Mulungu, nū yūyo aligasīgije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we a balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo bibeeleja, nguno mukafunyaga īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya shikolo shido do do, gītī shisanjo sha mu shilīwa;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shisanjo sha mu shilīwa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Madūūtū malebe na miji milebe īyo banhū bakasanjaga mu shilīwa; lol. Na Luk 11:42.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " alīyo ī mihayo mitaale ī ya mu malange, gītī kūlamula mu būtūngīlīja, na kūchīla shigongo, na kūzunya; ī yene mukīlekaga. Shing'wigeleelilwe kwīshikīlīja ī yenīyī, gwike nī yīngī īyo yaya ū kwīleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we batongeeji babboku, ū nīmo gwing'we ū ntaale gūlī gwa kūyūnga gītī ng'wiyūngīlo, na kūyūsolanhya, ng'waponya ū būfune, lelo ī ngamīla ng'wajimila! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo bibeeleja, nguno mukiyoogelelejaga higūlya gūlya gītī kooja shikombe na mabakuli, alīyo ū mu gatī ng'okalile wibi na kwikūmva kwabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe Mfalisayo mboku, ojaga tame ū mu gatī ya shikombe sheele, hūna ūshooje nī hanze! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo bibeeleja, nguno mubizile gītī shigila īsho shikubonagwa shawiza a higūlya, īkī shizengeelilwe shūbilwa na swakala, alīyo ū mu gatī shokalile maguha ga bafu, na būsoso bo mbika jose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo mukabonekanīlaga ū kū banhū; a higūlya mulī batūngīlīja, alīyo ū mu gatī ng'okalile wibeeleja na būgomi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango gūliza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo na Bafalisayo, nguno ī shigila sha bahangi mukashizengeelaga, ng'wayūgaliila na mashigo ga batūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūnū mukūhayaga gīkī, ‘Ūlū ni twalī tūlīho ū mu shikū ja bakūlūgenji bise, ni tūtizunīlīgije nabo ū mu kūgiita a mininga ga bahangi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kūhaya gīko, mukwikaanīlaga bing'we benekīlī gīkī mulī baana ba babūlagi ba bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya yokalīlījagi ī ngelekelo ya basīng'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we abo mulī nzoka, na būbyīle wa shipīlī, mukūgwiliga ginehe ū nsango gwa moto? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū managi gīkī, nalīmutūmīla hangī bahangi, na banhū bitegeleja na balangi, bamò mukūbabūlaga na kūbakoma ha misalaba, bamò babo mukūyūbatūlīla mu masinagogi ging'we; nīyo mukūyūja mukūbahīgaga hose hose ū mu mizengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha a mininga ga beela pye a bose gidīkīle ha mitwe ying'we; pye ayo gaamala kwitwa ha sī, kwandīja ga ntūngīlīja Abeli, kwiza kūkaja kū ga ng'wa Zakalia ng'wana Belekia, ūyo mukamūlagīla mu hekalu kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, ī yose īyī īkūbagwīla a banhū ba shibyalīlwe īshi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgūlīlīīla nzengo gwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu, mūlagibo bahangi; bebe ūyo ūkabapondaga mawe abo ūkatūmīlagwa. Nashishaga ng'hangala jinga nakūmanagūgema kūbakuminga kuminga a baana bako, gīt'ūmo ngoko īkakumingīlaga zwiyū jayo yajibandīla mu manana gayo; alīyo ūtatogilwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī olekelagwa buyīkī ī numba yako! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalīkūwīla ūtūnibona hangī kūshisha aho ūkūhaya gīkī, ‘Alī na lubango ūyo aliza mu lina lya ng'wa Seeba!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
